000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID.    BILLCALC.
000300 AUTHOR.       BILLING.
000400 DATE-WRITTEN. 09/12/88.
000500*------------------------------------------------------------
000600* BILLCALC - COMPUTE THE MONTHLY BILL FOR EACH ACCOUNT.
000700* PARAGRAPHS ARE SEPARATED BY EMPTY NUMBERED LINES.
000800*------------------------------------------------------------
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-ZOS.
001200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-ZOS.
001300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001400 FILE-CONTROL.
001500     SELECT BIL-FILE ASSIGN TO BILLIN
001600         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001700         FILE STATUS IS WS-BIL-STATUS.
001800 DATA DIVISION.
001900 FILE SECTION.
002000 FD  BIL-FILE
002100     RECORDING MODE IS F.
002200     COPY BILREC.
002300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002400 01  WS-BIL-STATUS          PIC X(2).
002500     88  WS-BIL-EOF             VALUE '10'.
002600 01  WS-PRINT-LINE.
002700     05                         PIC X(6) VALUE 'BILL: '.
002800     05  WS-PRT-ACCT            PIC X(10).
002900     05                         PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
003000     05  WS-PRT-AMOUNT          PIC -Z(8)9.99.
003100 01  WS-SIGNED.
003200     05  WS-ADJUST PIC S9(7)V99 SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
003300     05  WS-CREDIT              PIC S9(5) SIGN TRAILING SEPARATE.
003400 01  WS-RATE                PIC 9V9(4) VALUE 0.0725.
003500 01  WS-MODE                PIC X(8).
003600 01  WS-LEN                 PIC 9(4).
003700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003800 0000-MAIN.
003900     MOVE 'BINARY' TO WS-MODE
004000     MOVE 12 TO WS-LEN
004100     OPEN INPUT BIL-FILE
004200     PERFORM 1000-NEXT-BILL UNTIL WS-BIL-EOF
004300     CLOSE BIL-FILE
004400     GOBACK.
004500
004600 1000-NEXT-BILL.
004700     READ BIL-FILE
004800        AT END
004900           SET WS-BIL-EOF TO TRUE
005000        NOT AT END
005100           PERFORM 2000-COMPUTE
005200     END-READ.
005300
005400 2000-COMPUTE.
005500     COMPUTE BIL-TAX = BIL-AMOUNT * WS-RATE
005600     IF BIL-TAX < ZERO
005700        PERFORM 2100-ADJUST
005800     END-IF
005900     PERFORM 3000-PRINT.
006000
006100 2100-ADJUST.
006200     MOVE BIL-TAX TO WS-ADJUST.
006300
006400 3000-PRINT.
006500     MOVE BIL-ACCT TO WS-PRT-ACCT
006600     MOVE BIL-AMOUNT TO WS-PRT-AMOUNT
006700     DISPLAY WS-PRINT-LINE.
006800
